# AI-DLC workflow artifacts are tracked in the repo: they record how the code got
# built (state, audit, design docs) and the workflow rules themselves, so the
# process is reproducible and reviewable. CLAUDE.md is the workflow contract.

# Binaries
/bin/
/chiller
*.exe
*.out

# Test / coverage
*.test
coverage.out
coverage.html

# Go
vendor/
go.work
go.work.sum

# Secrets — real credentials never enter the repo (SECURITY-12).
# deploy/compose/.env.example is the committed template and holds no key material.
deploy/compose/.env
sbom.cyclonedx.json

# Editor / OS
.idea/
.vscode/
.DS_Store
.claude/
